[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10200.07, "timestamp": "02:50:00", "text": "一旦我到了日本，一旦我完全……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10202.79, "timestamp": "02:50:02", "text": "一切都得我自己处理。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10205.269, "timestamp": "02:50:05", "text": "我。现在，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10212.15, "timestamp": "02:50:12", "text": "那将会是件大事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10215.11, "timestamp": "02:50:15", "text": "自泡沫经济以来，日本已经变得非常擅长"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10217.51, "timestamp": "02:50:17", "text": "崎岖的地形，在那里找个地方落脚"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10219.75, "timestamp": "02:50:19", "text": "住在那里，他们更关心"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10223.349, "timestamp": "02:50:23", "text": "是的，就业比……好。还有那方面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10225.269, "timestamp": "02:50:25", "text": "是的。是的。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10233.99, "timestamp": "02:50:33", "text": "拥有一个资金中心球员真是太好了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10235.51, "timestamp": "02:50:35", "text": "这只是意味着它会贬值。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10237.349, "timestamp": "02:50:37", "text": "因为通货膨胀。你的大部分"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10239.19, "timestamp": "02:50:39", "text": "储蓄应该投资于很多方面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10241.269, "timestamp": "02:50:41", "text": "共同基金。所以，你让被动模式生效。"}]